alette:</strong> Blush, white, and sea-blue tones make the family look cohesive in photos.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Dress movement:</strong> The maxi silhouettes and braided straps keep the women's and girls' side airy and easy.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Shirt polish:</strong> The collared button-front shirts add a clean finish for dads and boys without feeling stiff.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Vacation-ready comfort:</strong> Lightweight woven cotton keeps the whole set breathable for warm-weather plans.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose each role and size you need, and build a family matching look that feels calm, polished, and ready for the next sunny memory.</p>","tags":["Beach","Blue","Boy Shirt","Braided Strap","Child 2 Years","Child 3 Years","Child 4 Years","Child 5 Years","Child 6-7 Years","Child 8 Years","Child 9-10 Years","Daddy and Me","Dress & Shirt","Family Matching","Father 2XL","Father 3XL","Father 4XL","Father L","Father M","Father S","Father Shirt","Father XL","Four-Role Matching","Girl Dress","https://detail.1688.com/offer/1028758846873.html","Mandarin Knot","Matching Family Dress","Matching Family Outfits","Matching Family Set","Matching Family Shirt","Maxi Dress","Mommy and Me","Mother 2XL","Mother Dress","Mother L","Mother M","Mother S","Mother XL","Multicolor","Ombre","Pink","Pink Horizon","Resort","Sets","Short Sleeve Shirt","Sleeveless Dress","Summer","Summer Family Matching Set","Vacation","Watercolor","White"],"seo":{"title":"Pink Horizon Family Matching Set | Dress Like Mommy","description":"Lightweight woven cotton family matching set with ombre dresses and knot shirts for mom, dad, girls & boys. Sizes 2Y–10Y, Mother S–2XL, Father S–4XL."},"category":{"id":"gid://shopify/TaxonomyCategory/aa-1-11","fullName":"Apparel & Accessories > Clothing > Outfit Sets"},"options":[{"id":"gid://shopify/ProductOption/9616965271649","name":"Type","position":1,"values":["Dress","Shirt"],"optionValues":[{"id":"gid://shopify/ProductOptionValue/6138291388513","name":"Dress","hasVariant